  "description": "As a much brighter alternative to dim, yellow headlights, a high-grade clear lens offers better visibility. Made of superior OEM grade ABS plastic to ensure durability for years ahead.\nFitment\n2003-2008 Toyota Corolla\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nBrighter & Wider Lighting\nThis upgraded headlight assembly adopts special meticulous chrome plating to increase the brightness and ultra-wide angle for better visibility in any dusky conditions to make your drive safer.\nWeather-Sealed\nThe fully sealed structure improves the waterproof rating for effectively preventing moisture from entering the inside of headlights for longer service life.\nHigh-grade Housing Material\nThe superior lens features good transmission, high toughness, and excellent UV resistance to prevent yellowing & cracking; and the upgraded housing is shock-proof and heat-proof for ensuring better durability compared with other headlights.\nDirect Replacement\nProfessional Installation would be highly recommended. No extra gaps after installation for a perfect fit. Comes with a complete set of headlights, including Driver (Left) & Passenger (Right) sides.",
